@Tenisu.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5287

### Health check
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/healthcheck

### All players, best first (default sort)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players
Accept: application/json

### All players, explicit sort
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players?sort=BestFirst
Accept: application/json

### Unknown sort (400 validation problem)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players?sort=42
Accept: application/json

### Statistics
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players/statistics
Accept: application/json

### Known player
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players/52
Accept: application/json

### Unknown player (404 problem)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players/999
Accept: application/json

### Non-numeric id (404 from routing)
GET {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players/abc

### Add a player (201 + Location; run twice for a 409)
POST {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Emma",
  "lastName": "Echo",
  "shortName": "E.ECH",
  "sex": "F",
  "country": { "code": "ITA", "picture": "" },
  "picture": "",
  "data": { "rank": 5, "points": 1200, "weight": 62000, "height": 172, "age": 24, "last": [1, 0, 1, 1, 0] }
}

### Invalid player (400 validation problem)
POST {{Tenisu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Emma",
  "shortName": "eech",
  "sex": "F",
  "country": { "code": "ita" },
  "data": { "rank": 0, "points": 1200, "weight": 62000, "height": 172, "age": 24, "last": [1, 2] }
}
